# Generated eval reports — local artifacts, not source. Keep the folder, ignore the runs.
#
# The pattern used to list `framing-*.md` only, while ANSWER-README.md claimed every run was
# git-ignored. It was not: two answer-*.md reports were committed in July. Those two are left tracked
# deliberately — removing committed files is Erik's call, not a wrap's — but nothing new lands here.
#
# It matters more than tidiness for the newer harnesses: a report holds the model's FULL prose across
# every arm, including prophetic attributions the egress wall refused. That is exactly the text this
# repo is careful about publishing, and a report is regenerable in minutes.
framing-*.md
answer-*.md
grounding-*.md
